Standard &amp; Poors: BBB+, BBB  Fitch Rating: BBB+, BBB Moody's Rating: Baa1, Baa2
R6 Bancolombia: R6 BRC: BBB- Fitch: BBB- Value and Risk: BBB- 
Standard &amp; Poors: BBB- Fitch Rating: BBB- Moody's Rating: Baa3
