Calidad Crediticia Baja
R8 Bancolombia: BRC:B+,B,B- Fitch :B+,B,B-  
Standard &amp; Poors: :B+,B,B-  Fitch Rating: :B+,B,B- y  Moody's Rating: B1,B2,B3
